              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I don't normally keep ice cream in the house so I used two extra spoonfuls of Stacy's organic vanilla yogurt. I didn't add the extra sugar, used fat free milk and I used my own homemade chocolate syrup. The kids thought this was great."
