              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jesusgirl316"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This smoothie is amazing! I was a little hesitant about the chocolate syrup, but you can't really taste it. I'm a huge fan of strawberry smoothies and this was one of the first recipes I tried and is still my favorite!",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-04T12:51:07.063Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
