            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Holiday Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this tasted pretty good. At first sip, it tasted a bit tart, but the more I drank it the more I liked it. It mostly tasted like strawberry frozen yogurt with bananas. I couldn't really taste the chocolate. Only changes I made was using 1/2 the fat vanilla ice cream, 1% milk, and a packet of Truvia for the sugar. I also only had about 6oz of yogurt, but it was more than plenty. This is definitely closer to a frozen yogurt shake or drink than a smoothie, but I wanted something like that anyway. TY",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-10T16:11:46.037Z"
          },
